WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.080
Mark.

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.920
And three, two, one, action.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.960
Season one
is a show about survival

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.040
and loss.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.560
How it all starts,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.760
and how everybody
realizes the new situation.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.080
We are in the plane,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.080
and we are traveling
with our group.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.360
A bunch of people who were
not supposed to be together

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.200
who need to survive together

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:41.440
because the sun is deadly,
and they have to fly into the night.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.680
The decisions we make
are mostly short-term decisions.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.360
"What are we eating now"?

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.240
"Do we have enough water"?

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.040
A run, basically,
a race, against the sun.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.920
This season
is a very different atmosphere.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.920
We're not running.
We are staying there,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.160
trying to survive.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:08.600
Season two is about this group

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.840
who became a kind of tribe,

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.440
despite the differences.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:21.880
And there are jumps
into a military context.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.600
We are shooting in a bunker,

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.760
not anymore in the plane.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:29.080
So we have more space.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.760
So it's better.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:34.800
Here we have
some good old human beings

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.800
who become threats as well.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.760
Passengers from season one,
they arrive at the bunker,

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.200
and they think they're all safe,
and they are safe.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.560
But we start to have problems
inside the bunker

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:53.080
because the passengers
start to do whatever they like.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.200
And, of course, you can't do that
in a military setting.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.360
When you're in a tough situation,

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.400
when you're scared,
when you're feeling vulnerable,

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.760
then you tend
to not trust other people,

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.240
and you tend to get defensive
and, like, go into your fears.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:13.520
We're here to save people,
not kill them, right?

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.880
The characters are
getting crazier every day

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:19.400
because they have to deal
with lots of grieving,

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:22.880
and most of
the living beings in the world

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.880
have died just one month ago,

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.760
and they don't have the time
to handle that.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:30.600
So they're getting more violent.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:34.800
You have to draw a whole
new world of rules and regulations,

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.880
and some people are happy
about your choices,

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.080
and some people are not.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.680
This is a military facility
under a military command.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.120
And when an order is given,

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:47.880
it shall be followed.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.280
In second season,

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.680
there's gonna be
more passion, more danger.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.840
More speed. We have more tension.
We have more love, more emotions.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.960
You're not going to miss the plane
because there are helicopters,

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.680
there are other planes,
there is a bunker,

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.240
there is a seed vault.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.880
You take the same, you do it better,
and this is second season.

